WIP

- @lemmer: Ernst Lemmer will lead our party.
- @dietrich: Hermann Dietrich will lead our party.
- @luther: Hans Luther will lead our party.
- @curtius: Julius Curtius will lead our party.
- @heuss: Theodor Heuss will lead our party.

@lemmer
subtitle: Lemmer is a prominent labor leader.
unavailable-subtitle: Lemmer isn’t seen as a viable candidate, with the party viewing him as too left-wing. He has endorsed Dietrich or Thiel.
#choose-if: 
on-arrival: dvp_leader = "Lemmer"
face-image: img/portraits/LemmerErnst.jpg

WIP.
  

